            j--;
        }

        arr[j + 1] = key;
    }
}
```

❓ What’s wrong if I want to sort in **ascending order**?

---

✅ **Fix:** You're comparing `key > arr[j]`, which is wrong for ascending sort.  
This makes it sort in **descending** order.

```c
